<p>As it sometimes happens with multi-generation businesses, over the years their brand became neglected and was in need of a serious boost. They reached out to us for creative guidance on branding, packaging, as well as the website and digital marketing. We even helped them update the look of their cafe and delivery vans!</p>
<p>We&#8217;re really pleased with the result of our partnership and are excited to help the third-generation Wogans grow the business into a nationally recognisable brand.</p>
</div></span></div><div class="Intro_projectDetails__UWcsm"><div class="Intro_left__d8bha"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Industry</p><p>Coffee</p></div><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Location</p><p>Bristol, UK</p></div></span></div><div class="Intro_right__E3UWy"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div><p class="Intro_smallHeading__gYXTn">Featured by</p><div class="Intro_list__65yay"><a href="https://www.awwwards.com/sites/wogan-coffee" target="_blank">Awwwards</a><a href="https://mindsparklemag.com/design/wogan-coffee/" target="_blank">Mindsparkle</a><a href="https://www.cssdesignawards.com/sites/wogan-coffee/42201/" target="_blank">CSSDA</a></div></div></span></div></div><div class="Intro_link__Wrq2r"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><a href="https://wogancoffee.com/" target="_blank" style="background-color:#017223;border-color:#017223"><span>Visit site</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 12.6 12.6" class="Intro_buttonArrow___9UE0"><path fill="#fff" d="M11.85 12.6c-.41 0-.75-.34-.75-.75V1.5H.75C.34 1.5 0 1.16 0 .75S.34 0 .75 0h11.1c.41 0 .75.34.75.75v11.1c0 .41-.34.75-.75.75z"></path><path fill="#fff" d="M1.13 12.21c-.19 0-.38-.07-.53-.22a.754.754 0 010-1.06L11.32.22c.29-.29.77-.29 1.06 0 .29.29.29.77 0 1.06L1.66 11.99c-.15.15-.34.22-.53.22z"></path></svg></a></span></div></div></section><section class="ContentBuilder_contentBuilder__FAKQG"><section class="MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ " data-margin="default" style="background-color:transparent"><div class="StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm"><div class="container"><div class="MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout6__wJx6J"><div class="MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/03-1400x788.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-