0w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/06-768x431.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/06-1536x862.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/06-2048x1149.jpg 2048w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/06.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1374" width="2448" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h2>Website.</h2>
<p>The new website engages users with the brand story and also simplifies the navigation around their wide selection of coffee. The UX had to be split between B2B customers interested in white label or bulk orders for cafes and shops, and B2C for consumers wanting their daily coffee fix.</p>
<p>We also wanted to highlight Wogan&#8217;s flexible subscription offer and entice users to easily sign up for the service, whether via the subscription page or directly from product pages. We also created a coffee quiz which allows users to easily tailor their coffee deliveries based on personal tastes.</p>
<p>Navigating the world of specialty coffee can be tricky, so we also created a coffee guide functionality as a part of their content hub, alongside the blog.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
</div></span></div></div></section><section class="MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ " data-margin="default" style="background-color:transparent"><div class="StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm"><div class="container"><div class="MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout1__6P6Mg"><div class="MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-1400x788.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-2000x1126.jpg 2000w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-500x281.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-768x432.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-1536x865.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07-2048x1153.jpg 2048w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/07.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1378" width="2448" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media2__Uc1vY" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/woganimage.jpg 1190w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/woganimage-432x500.jpg 432w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/woganimage-768x889.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/woganimage.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1378" width="1190" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media3__rEmNG" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/08.jpg 1188w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/08-431x500.jpg 431w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/08-768x891.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/08.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1378" width="1188" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="SingleImage_singleImage__NY3zv" data-margin="default"><div class="ImageEnter_image__FSEP_" data-fill="false"><div class="SingleImage_fullWidthImage__nPNe8"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_fill__EiIzS"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-1400x788.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-2000x1125.jpg 2000w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-500x281.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-768x432.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-2048x1152.jpg 2048w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/10-2560x1440.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1440" width="2560" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h2>Branding &amp; packaging.</h2>
<p>Wogan made it clear from the start that their company&#8217;s story was truly important to them, both the multi-generational family-run aspect and the close relationships they created with coffee farmers. They wanted the branding to reflect their history and friendly attitude while highlighting their dedication to sustainability and fair trade. We helped them establish their positioning in the coffee market and ensured their values are reflected in the new brand.</p>
<p>Wogan’s connection to their founding grandfather (and his bowler hat) that had adorned their packaging for years led us to create a sleek iconographic re-interpretation of Mr Wogan. This vector graphic allowed them to retain the heart and character of the original brand while transitioning into a modern and premium feel.</p>
<p>For the packaging, we utilised a fresh green colour palette to highlight the origin story of their green coffee beans, which they hand roast at their factory in Bristol. We then created a wider colour palette based on bright pastel shades of natural colours, connecting to different aspects of coffee production. It allowed us to create alternating coloured labels for their ever-changing range of coffees, as well as to colour-code the different areas of the website. Now it finally is just as premium as the coffee itself!</p>
</div></span></div></div></section><section class="MediaGallery_mediaGallery__vB7wJ " data-margin="default" style="background-color:transparent"><div class="StaggeredItems_grid__5Yycm"><div class="container"><div class="MediaGallery_grid___30fo MediaGallery_layout7__cljGj"><div class="MediaGallery_media1__9Ryxs" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/11.jpg 1188w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/11-431x500.jpg 431w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/11-768x891.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/11.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1378" width="1188" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media2__Uc1vY" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/12.jpg 1190w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/12-432x500.jpg 432w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/12-768x889.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/12.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1378" width="1190" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media3__rEmNG" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-1400x854.jpg 1400w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-2000x1219.jpg 2000w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-500x305.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-768x468.jpg 768w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-1536x937.jpg 1536w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-2048x1249.jpg 2048w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/13-2560x1561.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1561" width="2560" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media4__biNHW" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/15.jpg 1188w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/15-500x500.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/15-768x768.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/15.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1188" width="1188" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div><div class="MediaGallery_media5__PFPPK" data-animation="grid-item"><span class="Image_image__RAAdZ Image_intrinsic__JRoea"><img data-srcset="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/14.jpg 1190w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/14-500x500.jpg 500w, /__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/14-768x767.jpg 768w" data-src="/__external__/kota-content.b-cdn.net/app/uploads/2023/10/14.jpg" alt="" fetchPriority="low" height="1188" width="1190" sizes="auto" class="lazyload"/></span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="TextLeftListRight_textLeftListRight__i5dfy" data-margin="default" data-right-empty="true" style="--brand-color:red"><div class="container"><div class="TextLeftListRight_left__fjEbB"><span class="FadeIn_container__bjQVL" data-fill="false"><div class="prose"><h2>Digital Marketing.</h2>
<p>Alongside the brand and website, we also guided Wogan&#8217;s digital marketing strategy to grow the DTC side of the business. Based on the knowledge we had about the business, we helped them establish the target audiences and position the brand accordingly amongst competitors, as well as researched opportunities for each digital marketing channel.</p>
<p>We suggested &#8216;Coffee that doesn&#8217;t cost the Earth&#8217; as the guiding motto, highlighting their commitment to sustainability and fair pricing for both customers and farmers. To re-introduce the new Wogan we created a dynamic video showcasing the company, the family and their values.</p>
<p>Wogan also wanted us to support their digital marketing with our strategy and design expertise to help grow their brand awareness. We manage their socials, email marketing, SEO, and Google Ads. Check out their Insta at <a href="https://www.instagram.com/wogancoffee/">@wogancoffee</a>.</p>
